This project is the smallest form of Graph Coder: the meta system, plus the
corrections collected across real runs, in one skill file with no tooling. Its
three phases, three roles, single manager review gate, contract fields, dispatch
mechanics, and budget rules are carried over from Graph Coder Lite. What is not
carried over is everything that enforced them mechanically: the `gcl` CLI and its
readiness checks, the JSON run state and recovery, approval bound to a contract
hash, and the recorded usage ledger. Enforcement moves to the Director.

